<title>JAPAN: Fukoku - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fukoku - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.38		vs	   13.23</p>
<p> Operating	  752 million	 vs	  916 million</p>
<p> Current	    788 million	 vs	  964 million</p>
<p> Net		  367 million	 vs	  661 million</p>
<p> EPS		   25.24 yen	  vs	   46.58 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fukoku Co Ltd is an independent major maker of industrial-use rubber products, mostly for cars.</p>
